                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "Bordens"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "40210935-9e86-344f-ae60-0f04c30046a1",
                        "entry_id": "fa221094-4ce7-3b8a-951d-88f7fa42e31f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative form of Robert Borden."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "alt-of",
                            "alternative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ba8c5457-facd-4db6-a531-8824c70b0ca6",
                                "sense_id": "40210935-9e86-344f-ae60-0f04c30046a1",
                                "text": "I wrapped the wad of small bills inside about thirty Bordens from Luc's bag."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "044ac4ab-25d6-4989-ba60-2450eba46bc4",
                                "sense_id": "40210935-9e86-344f-ae60-0f04c30046a1",
                                "text": "It's all about the Benjamins - although in view of a soaring loonie, player agents wish it were about the Bordens."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc9f72ba-d44e-4ad7-bd6c-3540a1f854db",
                                "sense_id": "40210935-9e86-344f-ae60-0f04c30046a1",
                                "text": "I tried to tell him that greedy Canadians were supposed to be all about the Bordens, but he was too busy preparing his fourth-quarter mission statement to pay attention to such petty nationalistic details."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
